  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/459fad44-da37-49a6-99e9-83085f49c48d\" alt=\"cflogobanner\"></p><h3><strong>关于：</strong></h3><p>机械动力：食物 是一款以扩展Minecraft中食物内容为基础的附加模组。</p><p>这些模组虽非强制要求，但不可或缺。缺少它们，许多物品将无法合成。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a></li>\n</ul><p>这些模组非必需但推荐安装。缺少它们，部分体验会明显不完整。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Display Delight</a></li>\n</ul><p>有关与机械动力及农夫乐事附属模组兼容性的信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><h3><strong>当前内容：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>超过1000种食物相关物品及100余种新流体。查看物品清单请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Item-list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>所有内容均可高度自定义，包括隐藏物品、修改营养/饱和度数值，以及添加自定义物品、方块、流体和展示盘。了解更多请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Config-Options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>完整实现了来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's Do系列</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a>等模组的效果。</li>\n<li>针对简易合成配方的手工制作系统。了解更多请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Handcrafting-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>任何物品均可放置于盘上展示。你还可以直接从盘中食用，或将其用作砧板。阅读指南请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Display-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>布料滤网可手持使用或用于配方。了解更多请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Cloth-Filters-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>两种存储方块：布袋与口粮箱。了解更多请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food-multiloader/wiki/Storage-Blocks-Guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</li>\n<li>可放置的披萨、蛋糕、派（包括南瓜派）等方块。</li>\n<li>热饮的动画材质。</li>\n</ul><p>有关2.0.0之前版本的信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-food/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><h3><strong>物品预览（2.5.0）</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a20d646f-981a-4eaa-8755-852639e6cd96\" alt=\"fullprev250\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/993237fc-c7c8-4325-a47b-9e9401f5b213\" alt=\"bucketprev240\"></p><h3><strong>我的其他模组</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：工程师</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metalwork-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：金属工艺</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">符文精华</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>鸣谢：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>材质基于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>中的资源。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
